/-- p05013 — 5:C2, 29:C10. No internal mirror: fewer than $s^{K+1}$ records exist, so an agent with $s^{K+1}<N$ holds no injective representation of the domain of $W_N$ --- a proper part cannot mirror the whole (pigeonhole). -/
